#: scenario8:scenario8_CC6269F6_C182_47A5_A27F_C3CBCD0CD659
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5396447213a20629d6130c6777ab1c5de9136f70e6452b40051a7bc14c3d7920
